Subject: [PATCH 1/7] test(disputes): reproduce two accept_dispute_claim bugs

- note is validated with DISPUTE_ID_REGEX, so any note with a space or
  punctuation is rejected as "Invalid PayPal Dispute ID"
- dispute_id and note are passed as axios params, so they leak into the
  POST URL's query string

Adds a jest test script (jest.config.ts and ts-jest were already present)
and a typecheck script. Tests fail on this commit by design.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
